    <title>flatpaper 主题 音乐播放器搭建</title>
    <updated>2026-11-13T05:53:56.757Z</updated>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <author>
      <name>七七</name>
    </author>
    <category term="技术" scheme="http://example.com/categories/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/"/>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" class="aplayer-secondary-style-marker" href="https://registry.npmmirror.com/aplayer/1.10.1/files/dist/APlayer.min.css"><script src="https://registry.npmmirror.com/aplayer/1.10.1/files/dist/APlayer.min.js" class="aplayer-secondary-script-marker"></script><script class="meting-secondary-script-marker" src="https://registry.npmmirror.com/meting/1.2.0/files/dist/Meting.min.js"></script><p><img src="/images/photo2.jpg"></p><h2 id="一、环境准备与hexo初始化"><a href="#一、环境准备与hexo初始化" class="headerlink" title="一、环境准备与hexo初始化"></a>一、环境准备与hexo初始化</h2><p>1、安装前置软件</p><p>Node.js下载16.x及以上版本</p><p>Git 官网下载</p><p>2、打开终端，验证安装</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">node -v  </span><br><span class="line">npm -v</span><br><span class="line">git --version</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>3、 全局安装 Hexo</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install -g hexo-cli</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="4、初始化博客"><a href="#4、初始化博客" class="headerlink" title="4、初始化博客"></a>4、初始化博客</h3><p>找一个空文件夹，执行：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo init my-blog</span><br><span class="line">cd my-blog</span><br><span class="line">npm install</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>初始化后的目录结构</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">my-blog/</span><br><span class="line">├── _config.yml      # 站点主配置文件</span><br><span class="line">├── package.json     # 依赖包信息</span><br><span class="line">├── scaffolds/       # 文章模板</span><br><span class="line">├── source/          # 文章、页面资源</span><br><span class="line">│   ├── _drafts/     # 草稿</span><br><span class="line">│   └── _posts/      # 已发布文章</span><br><span class="line">└── themes/          # 主题文件夹</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>本地预览</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean   # 清除缓存</span><br><span class="line">hexo g       # 生成静态页面</span><br><span class="line">hexo s       # 启动本地服务器</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>浏览器访问 <code>http://localhost:4000</code>，就能看到默认的 Hexo 博客了</p><h2 id="二、部署到-GitHub-Pages（免费上线）"><a href="#二、部署到-GitHub-Pages（免费上线）" class="headerlink" title="二、部署到 GitHub Pages（免费上线）"></a>二、部署到 GitHub Pages（免费上线）</h2><h3 id="1-创建-GitHub-仓库"><a href="#1-创建-GitHub-仓库" class="headerlink" title="1. 创建 GitHub 仓库"></a>1. 创建 GitHub 仓库</h3><p>新建仓库，仓库名必须为：<code>你的用户名.github.io</code>（例如 <code>tom.github.io</code>），选择 Public</p><h3 id="2-安装部署插件"><a href="#2-安装部署插件" class="headerlink" title="2. 安装部署插件"></a>2. 安装部署插件</h3><p>在博客根目录执行</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-deployer-git --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-配置部署信息"><a href="#3-配置部署信息" class="headerlink" title="3. 配置部署信息"></a>3. 配置部署信息</h3><p>打开根目录 <code>_config.yml</code>，拉到最底部修改 <code>deploy</code> 配置：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">deploy:</span><br><span class="line">  type: git</span><br><span class="line">  repo: https://github.com/你的用户名/你的用户名.github.io.git</span><br><span class="line">  branch: main</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>一键部署</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo g &amp;&amp; hexo d</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]>
    </content>
